    {
        "text": "Give it up, Matterhorn.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "text": "You know better than anyone how stubborn Sir Enciodes is. You knew he wouldn't accept, so why ask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I must at least try.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is too... risky.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Matterhorn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_198_blackd_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_199_yak_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Risk and opportunity are two sides of the same coin. It's always been this way for us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we have to do is listen to him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Weiss"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowstormflp",
