    {
        "text": "He's taking too long.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "What a showy guy he must be to have the two other clans wait for him?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "He's walking all the way here. That's not so bad, if you ask me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What a surprise. You are commending him? From what I heard, Enciodes is enjoying quite the celebrity status on his way here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Arctosz, you'd best be careful. Give it a few more days and Kjeragandr's most devout follower will be Enciodes instead of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough of your jabs, Ratatos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#10$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't trust Enciodes, but if he does right thing, who am I to argue?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now if you brought me here just to say this, you'll have to excuse me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't have so much free time on my hands, Arctosz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just wanted to remind you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Remind me? There's nothing I need you, of all people, to remind me of.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure about that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Arctosz, bickering at each other isn't going to help either of us. Given the circumstances, our families have the strongest ties.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not the one who's bickering, Ratatos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like how you and Enciodes are always beating around the bush. I care about actions and nothing else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You care about actions. Perfect, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's talk about the explosion two days ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What? Are you going to tell me that was the Browntails' doing? Hmph, I'm not falling for that. That's not your style.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Or are you trying to say you know who's behind it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What if I tell you I really do...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014You're not kidding?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_254_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Definitely not.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why don't you take a guess who gave us a helping hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
