    },
    {
        "text": "Monch, Monch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just where did she go...?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": 200,
        "fadetime": 0.3,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "characteraction",
        "name": "right",
        "type": "move",
        "xpos": -200,
        "fadetime": 1,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you looking for me, Madame?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you really need to ask?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You're usually pretty quick on your feet. Why're you wandering about like you're going to the park, now of all times?! I told you we must be ready for this hunt... Whatever, how are preparations going?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "To tell you the truth, Monch, you're the most dependable warrior I have.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's all down to you whether I can bring honor to the Browntail clan and get back at that bitch Ratatos!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#8$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "text": "Madame, if I may speak my mind...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#8$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "If you have something to say, say it!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "text": "As I see it, if you truly wish to impress Matriarch Ratatos with such a fine performance that she sees you in a new light, I'm afraid you should set your eyes on more than just the hunt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm aware of that... but what else could I do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Ratatos always has everything thought out well in advance. It's like she's not giving me any chances. Hmph, I'll admit she's a little smarter than me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "But I... I'm not useless either!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's why you have to make sure you do your job well, no matter what it takes, Monch!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "text": "You and I will sap some of that stinking bitch's arrogance together! I will show her how amazing I can be!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand how you feel about the Browntails, Madame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "But in that case, you should really set your eyes on more than just the hunt.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Tell me, then. What else could we do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#2$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If you trust my judgment\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#3$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What're you talking about? If I don't trust you, who else could I trust?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#7$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I appreciate your trust, Madame. So please leave this matter to me. I have a few ideas... but we need to be careful. It's not the right time to jump to conclusions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "text": "As for you, Madame, to make sure everything goes well, please do not tell Sir Yucatan about this affair.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#4$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not even Yucatan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#6$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. He's always in the way, treating me like a little girl. He even tells on me to Ratatos. As if I don't know...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll leave everything to you, Monch! Don't disappoint me!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Sciurus"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_262_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_255_1#6$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. Please rest assured...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "text": "When all is said and done, I will make sure you will get your time in the limelight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Monch"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
