    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_empty",
        "focus": 1,
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.1,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "'The sound of the bell rings from Her purest soul. Those who love Her cast their heads down to listen, and Kjeragandr shines her countenance upon all Her faithful children.'",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bigbell",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Listen. The bells of the hour have chimed.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You were almost late, Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "char_empty"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I beg forgiveness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "The path of enlightenment is always a treacherous one. This, too, must be one of Kjeragandr's trials for the Silverashes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You walked all the way from Turicum to Mount Karlan. It must have been an exhausting journey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "However... I hope you will find your right path forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "With your blessings, Great Saintess, the path ahead is shrouded no more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Even as we speak, I am making my way toward Kjeragandr's teachings.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "You have a fine way with words, Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You flatter me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I am profoundly humbled to be welcomed by the Great Saintess herself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "With the pomp and circumstance of your entrance, I wouldn't dare to give you the cold shoulder, Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#3$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Where can I find the Great Elder, if I may ask?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The Great Elder is preparing for the ceremony. Such is why I'm here to receive you myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "For this Holy Hunt, I shall follow Kjeragandr's will and stand alongside you to bring this ceremony to a successful conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#5$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You mean... you will personally take to the hunting grounds?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#5$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you too think my decision is a rash one, Sir Enciodes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#8$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Not in the slightest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm simply overcome with emotion. It seems you have come to realize the gravity of your position as leader of the three clans. It's a fortunate thing for Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's my responsibility.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_269"
    },
    {
        "text": "Great Saintess, Sir Enciodes, the Holy Hunt will begin shortly. Please hurry.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Servant"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It's nearly time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Please come with me, Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "name2": "avg_172_svrash_1#10$1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "After you, Great Saintess.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_snowbootwalk",
        "volume": 1,
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bse"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bse",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1",
        "fadetime": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Sir Enciodes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Whether your path is right or wrong, Kjerag has its own path to follow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one can decide for all of Kjeragandr's children.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I feel the same way...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our merits are not for others to judge. Now that things have come to this, there is no reason for me to back away. With my actions...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014I did all that I could, nothing more.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
