    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, as Saintess, hereby declare.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "I shall lead Kjerag's finest warriors to find and lay waste to all the Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4 hiding in the mountains, so that Kjerag may have peace.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_254_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, Arctosz, as always, will lead my warriors of the house of Paleroche, following the Saintess in her quest to find all Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4 hiding in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to bring back the most magnificent prey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Arctosz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_253_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, Ratatos, as always, will lead my warriors of the house of Browntail, following the Saintess in her quest to hunt down all Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4 hiding in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to bring back the most exquisite prey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ratatos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_172_svrash_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "By Kjeragandr.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "I, Enciodes, as always, will lead my warriors of the house of Silverash, following the Saintess in her quest to suppress all Tsch\u00e4gg\u00e4tt\u00e4 hiding in the mountains.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "text": "And to bring back the most ferocious prey.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enciodes"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "May our faith reach Kjeragandr, and may prosperity reach Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_258_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "May our faith reach Kjeragandr, and may prosperity reach Kjerag...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Great Elder"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "text": "May our faith reach Kjeragandr, and may prosperity reach Kjerag.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Tri-Clan Leaders"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014May our faith reach Kjeragandr, and may prosperity reach Kjerag!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Everyone in Attendance"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_174_slbell_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone, please check your equipment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let the hunt begin!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Enya"
    },
